[{"id":1251696,"node":"V2EX","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/v2ex","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c81e/728d/2_mini.png?m=1716587234","description":"好多 V 友都做过针对 V 站优化，有做油猴脚本的，chrome 插件的，有做 APP 的，各式各样，光我见过的不下 10 个了，说明大家对这个有需求的。<br />既然有需求为何 V 站不自己去做呢？<br />实在搞不懂，让 AI 来一梭子分分钟的事情。","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251696","replies":44,"created_ts":1792936959,"title":"有件事我搞不明白， V 站为何不升级一下交互和 UI？然后出一个官方的 APP？","author":"Veliqo","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/Veliqo","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4c6a/98fc/476881_mini.png?m=1792936997"},{"id":1251636,"node":"分享发现","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/share","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c74d/97b0/16_mini.png?m=1727584731","description":"我发现一个很奇怪，但也很有意思的现象。<br /><br />如果做一个 app ，开源免费发布出来，唉，不一定有多少人用。<br /><br />但是你说收费，然后发码，那就会有很多人要。<br /><br />挺奇怪的逻辑, 特别在 V2 上，我见过很多这样的。<br /><br />（当然，我说的这种 case 也不是绝对的<br /><br />有没有人愿意分析一下这是什么心理呢？ <br />如果是开源免费的 App ，（ AI Slop 除外），应该怎么样来运营呢？","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251636","replies":41,"created_ts":1792911452,"title":"有没有发现一个奇怪的现象？","author":"xueshi","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/xueshi","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d95b/6d57/26655_mini.png?m=1791460358"},{"id":1251671,"node":"问与答","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346","description":"","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251671","replies":38,"created_ts":1792924851,"title":"有没有感觉 Codex 越来越比不上 Claude 了","author":"Wenwener","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/Wenwener","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/08a2/c3c6/770470_mini.png?m=1764109775"},{"id":1251598,"node":"Bing","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/bing","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/0d0f/d7c6/408_mini.png?m=1606681712","description":"<p>最近发现一个非常奇怪的现象。</p>\n<p>在中国大陆使用 Bing 搜索时，输入一些知名国外网站的名称或域名，例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>themoviedb</code></li>\n<li><code>google</code></li>\n<li><code>youtube</code></li>\n<li><code>telegram</code></li>\n<li><code><a href=\"http://x.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">x.com</a></code></li>\n<li><code>openai</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bing 似乎不会优先展示这些网站的官方网站，甚至在搜索结果前几页都找不到官网入口，反而推荐各种第三方网站、教程、镜像站或无关页面。</p>\n<p>以 The Movie Database （ TMDB ）为例</p>\n<p>在 Bing 搜索 <code>themoviedb</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一条结果：<code>https://tmdb-pearl.vercel.app</code>，一个部署在 Vercel 上的第三方项目。</li>\n<li>第二条结果：<code><a href=\"https://themoviesdb.org\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://themoviesdb.org</a></code>，一个域名与官方网站非常相似的网站。</li>\n<li>官方网站：<code><a href=\"https://www.themoviedb.org\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.themoviedb.org</a></code>，在截图所示的结果中完全没有出现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>而在 Google 搜索同样的关键词，第一条就是 TMDB 官方网站。</p>\n<p>更奇怪的是，TMDB 并没有被墙</p>\n<p>Google 、YouTube 、Telegram 、X 、OpenAI 等网站在中国大陆存在访问限制。</p>\n<p>但 <strong><a href=\"http://themoviedb.org\" rel=\"nofollow\">themoviedb.org</a> 经过我实际测试，在国内可以正常访问，并没有被墙。</strong></p>\n<p>也就是说，这是一个可以正常访问、知名度也不低的影视数据库网站，但 Bing 却连它的官方网站都没有优先展示。</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251598","replies":31,"created_ts":1792892916,"title":"Bing 中国大陆搜索是否存在对部分国外网站的刻意降权或隐藏？","author":"charley008","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/charley008","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8016/59fe/440317_mini.png?m=1792892437"},{"id":1251616,"node":"OpenAI","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785","description":"<p>下午 3 点前\n<a href=\"https://codex-reset.com/zh/#signals\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://codex-reset.com/zh/#signals</a></p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251616","replies":29,"created_ts":1792899892,"title":"[Day 20] - 10.25 - Tibo 又要重置了","author":"privateproxies","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/privateproxies","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7ee6/54c8/496412_mini.png?m=1790052201"},{"id":1251609,"node":"问与答","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346","description":"<p>请问各位大神，有什么工具可以测试鼠标的微动是否有问题？</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251609","replies":29,"created_ts":1792897168,"title":"有什么工具可以测试鼠标的微动是否有问题","author":"crayhuang","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/crayhuang","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2355c30bd447cd8968525d193071a389?s=24&d=retro"},{"id":1251601,"node":"分享创造","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/create","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_mini.png?m=1660301119","description":"<p><img alt=\"v2ex 评论区楼层引用信息自动展示插件\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://www.mdview.cn/static/other/screenshot_marked.png\"/></p>\n<p>作用是，根据评论中的 #17 ，或者 @<a href=\"/member/xxx\">xxx</a> ，或者“十七楼”，这样的信息，找到最近的一条回复，自动在当前这条评论上方展示。</p>\n<p>刚刚已上架到 chrome 应用商店，搜索 “V2EX 评论上下文” 即可。\n插件免费开源 <a href=\"https://github.com/mdview2026/v2ex-comment-context\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/mdview2026/v2ex-comment-context</a></p>\n<p>解决了我自己遇到的一个痛点。如果对你也有用，就更好了。</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251601","replies":21,"created_ts":1792893543,"title":"搓了一个“V2EX 评论上下文”的 chrome 插件，方便 V 友阅读评论","author":"whoisharry","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/whoisharry","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9355/90f0/82025_mini.png?m=1784514405"},{"id":1251621,"node":"OpenAI","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785","description":"<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/UZZm3dU.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UZZm3dU.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /><br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/x5tsYce.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/x5tsYce.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br /><br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/B4nccST.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B4nccST.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251621","replies":19,"created_ts":1792902207,"title":"codex 最新的功能，居然和我之前做的小功能如此雷同","author":"break","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/break","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/d64d/2297/66852_mini.png?m=1789095648"},{"id":1251592,"node":"分享创造","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/create","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_mini.png?m=1660301119","description":"<p>昨天忽然想试试看让 ai 学习字帖的文字结构\n用一个真实字贴，学习后，生成任何文字的书法作品</p>\n<p>使用了三层动态书法异形引擎（同字异形 PUA 轮换 + 部件级错落微变 + 弹性笔势场与蘸墨呼吸）与随字赋形不等距纵向排版（ True Bounding-Box Vertical Kerning ），彻底消除电脑排字机械感。</p>\n<p>结果比我预想的好很多\n大概能到原字帖 90%水平</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://dvbs2000.github.io/liuchunlin-shufa/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://dvbs2000.github.io/liuchunlin-shufa/</a></p>\n<p>直接就可以体验，输入任何诗词文字，直接出书法作品下载</p>\n<p>这是 github 地址\n<a href=\"https://github.com/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa</a></p>\n<h3>3. 兰亭集序（简体）</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"lanting_simp.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/lanting_simp.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>4. 山居秋暝（繁体）</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"shanju_trad.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/shanju_trad.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>5. 心经（繁体）</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"xinjing_trad.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/xinjing_trad.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>6. 长恨歌展示</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"showcase_changhenge.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_changhenge.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>7. 春江花月夜 盲测对比</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"showcase_chunjiang_blindtest.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_chunjiang_blindtest.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>8. 字帖模拟效果</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"showcase_copybook_sim.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_copybook_sim.jpg\"/></p>\n<h3>9. 二维码印章演示</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"showcase_qr_seal_demo.jpg\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://fastly.jsdelivr.net/gh/dvbs2000/liuchunlin-shufa@main/docs/gallery/showcase_qr_seal_demo.jpg\"/></p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251592","replies":18,"created_ts":1792888908,"title":"用 ai 实现书法作品自动生成","author":"dvbs2000","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/dvbs2000","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/89fb/52e6/28162_mini.png?m=1792888715"},{"id":1251624,"node":"OpenAI","node_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/go/openai","node_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/fd2c/5e46/1135_mini.png?m=1751736785","description":"<p>微信是怎么屏蔽 codex 的，理论上 codex 是通过图形界面操作微信的，模仿人类的吧. 现在只要我让 codex 操作微信，微信就自动退出，让我重新登录。</p>\n","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251624","replies":16,"created_ts":1792904114,"title":"微信是怎么屏蔽 codex 的","author":"garydab","author_url":"https://www.v2ex.com/u/garydab","author_image":"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/521af8796ef869b9d7d793733957d035?s=24&d=retro"}]